sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as 管理員
    participant ChatRoom as 聊天室
    participant Bot as 社群機器人

    Admin->>ChatRoom: addMessage(Message("king", [@bot]))
    ChatRoom->>Bot: receive(NewMessage)

    Note over Bot: 目前：Normal / Default Conversation 或 Interacting
    Bot->>Bot: 處理目前狀態的聊天訊息
    alt Default Conversation
        Bot->>ChatRoom: addMessage(輪播回覆, [@管理員])
    else Interacting
        Bot->>ChatRoom: addMessage(輪播回覆, [@管理員])
    end

    Bot->>Bot: 驗證 @bot、Admin、quota >= 5
    alt 指令有效
        Bot->>Bot: quota -= 5
        Bot->>Bot: 進入 KnowledgeKing / Questioning
        Bot->>ChatRoom: addMessage("KnowledgeKing is started!", [])
        Bot->>ChatRoom: addMessage(第 0 題, [])
    else 指令無效
        Note over Bot: 靜默失敗；僅保留目前狀態的聊天回應
    end
